body:
The table shows the scores of some students in an examination. From the table, find

(i) how many students wrote the examination;

(ii) the modal score;

(iii) the number of students that scored 7 or more;

(iv) the mean score, correct to one decimal place.

The diagram is a triangle $ABC$ with the side $AC$ produced to $D$. Find

(i) the value of $x$;

(ii) angle $ACB$.
